    {
      "id": "campaign-7",
      "type": "campaign",
      "content": {
        "heading": "The Campaign",
        "text": "Next to the film we designed a webpage that brought all the most critical and mind-blowing facts of the plastic pollution crisis together on a single page. This webpage was hosted by Novo Amor and included interviews of experts and tips on how to get involved and be part of the solution. Thousands of his fans worldwide interacted with the information. Additionally we collaborated with the organization Plastic Oceans who included the film in their educational program and showcase it in schools around the world.",
